e hosting layer for the entire [&] ecosystem, its loop encodes the "},{"id":"spn-76862","marks":["bold"],"text":"deploy → invoke → meter → bill"},{"id":"spn-76863","text":" rhythm. Unlike other loops in the portfolio it is the only one whose substrates include both Cloudflare Workers and AWS AgentCore (per ADR-0001), and its "},{"id":"spn-76864","marks":["code"],"text":"act"},{"id":"spn-76865","text":" phase is intentionally pluggable through the Runtime Provider Interface (per "},{"id":"spn-76866","marks":["code"],"text":"20_RUNTIME_PROVIDER_INTERFACE.md"},{"id":"spn-76867","text":")."}]},{"id":"blk-49952","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-76868","marks":["bold"],"text":"Loop ID:"},{"id":"spn-76869","text":" "},{"id":"spn-76870","marks":["code"],"text":"webhost.deploy_invoke"},{"id":"spn-76871","text":" "},{"id":"spn-76872","marks":["bold"],"text":"Loop name:"},{"id":"spn-76873","text":" WebHost.Systems Deploy/Invoke Loop "},{"id":"spn-76874","marks":["bold"],"text":"Version:"},{"id":"spn-76875","text":" 1.0.0 "},{"id":"spn-76876","marks":["bold"],"text":"Owner:"},{"id":"spn-76877","text":" webhost.systems "},{"id":"spn-76878","marks":["bold"],"text":"Workspace scope:"},{"id":"spn-76879","text":" required"}]},{"id":"blk-49953","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-76880","marks":["bold"],"text":"Phases (5 canonical kinds):"}]},{"head":[{"id":"blk-49955","spans":[{"id":"spn-76881","text":"Phase ID"}]},{"id":"blk-49956","spans":[{"id":"spn-76882","text":"Kind"}]},{"id":"blk-49957","spans":[{"id":"spn-76883","text":"Description"}]}],"id":"blk-49954","kind":"table","rows":[[{"id":"blk-49958","spans":[{"id":"spn-76884","marks":["code"],"text":"retrieve_deployment"}]},{"id":"blk-49959","spans":[{"id":"spn-76885","marks":["code"],"text":"retrieve"}]},{"id":"blk-49960","spans":[{"id":"spn-76886","text":"Resolve "},{"id":"spn-76887","marks":["code"],"text":"agent_id → activeDeploymentId"},{"id":"spn-76888","text":" from Supabase control plane (per ADR-0005)"}]}],[{"id":"blk-49961","spans":[{"id":"spn-76889","marks":["code"],"text":"route_runtime"}]},{"id":"blk-49962","spans":[{"id":"spn-76890","marks":["code"],"text":"route"}]},{"id":"blk-49963","spans":[{"id":"spn-76891","text":"Select runtime provider via RPI (Cloudflare default, AgentCore premium, others as adapters)"}]}],[{"id":"blk-49964","spans":[{"id":"spn-76892","marks":["code"],"text":"act_invoke"}]},{"id":"blk-49965","spans":[{"id":"spn-76893","marks":["code"],"text":"act"}]},{"id":"blk-49966","spans":[{"id":"spn-76894","text":"Execute "},{"id":"spn-76895","marks":["code"],"text":"invoke/v1"},{"id":"spn-76896","text":" (per ADR-0006); stream SSE response if requested; capture telemetry"}]}],[{"id":"blk-49967","spans":[{"id":"spn-76897","marks":["code"],"text":"learn_telemetry"}]},{"id":"blk-49968","spans":[{"id":"spn-76898","marks":["code"],"text":"learn"}]},{"id":"blk-49969","spans":[{"id":"spn-76899","text":"Aggregate signed telemetry events; update usage counters; check tier entitlements"}]}],[{"id":"blk-49970","spans":[{"id":"spn-76900","marks":["code"],"text":"consolidate_billing"}]},{"id":"blk-49971","spans":[{"id":"spn-76901","marks":["code"],"text":"consolidate"}]},{"id":"blk-49972","spans":[{"id":"spn-76902","text":"Periodic aggregation by billing period; retention pruning; cost estimation rollups"}]}]]},{"id":"blk-49973","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-76903","marks":["bold"],"text":"Closure:"},{"id":"spn-76904","text":" "},{"id":"spn-76905","marks":["code"],"text":"consolidate_billing → retrieve_deployment"},{"id":"spn-76906","text":" via Supabase, guarantee "},{"id":"spn-76907","marks":["code"],"text":"eventual"},{"id":"spn-76908","text":"."}]},{"id":"blk-49974","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-76909","marks":["bold"],"text":"Cadence:"},{"id":"spn-76910","text":" Primary "},{"id":"spn-76911","marks":["code"],"text":"event"},{"id":"spn-76912","text":" (every invocation). Fallback "},{"id":"spn-76913","marks":["code"],"text":"periodic"},{"id":"sp